#: ../../tools/proteomicsdb_tools.rst:32 a71c4829c29948d2b2c62bcecc75a2e5
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get a tissue expression summary for a protein from "
"ProteomicsDB, showing the top tissues/cell lines/fluids ranked by MS-"
"based expression level. Given a UniProt accession, returns the top N "
"biological sources where the protein is most highly expressed (by iBAQ "
"quantification), along with total counts of tissues, cell lines, and body"
" fluids where the protein was detected. Useful for quickly identifying "
"which tissues/cell lines express a protein most abundantly based on mass "
"spectrometry evidence. Complements antibody-based tissue expression from "
"HPA."
msgstr ""

