#: ../../tools/proteomicsdb_tools.rst:70 edda13c12974431c80d8692e514e767a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get mass spectrometry-based protein expression data "
"across human tissues, cell lines, and body fluids from ProteomicsDB. "
"Given a UniProt accession (e.g., P04637 for TP53), returns quantitative "
"expression values (log10 iBAQ or TOP3) for each biological source where "
"the protein was detected. ProteomicsDB provides MS-based proteomics data "
"complementary to antibody-based expression in HPA and cancer proteomics "
"in PDC. Filter by tissue category (tissue, cell line, fluid) and "
"calculation method (iBAQ, TOP3). Expression values are log10-transformed "
"normalized intensities. Returns tissue name, group, category, and "
"expression statistics per source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/proteomicsdb_tools.rst:77 07cc15ae44624ffc8a5941ae9e380479
msgid ""
"``uniprot_id`` (string) (required) UniProt accession for the protein "
"(e.g., 'P04637' for TP53, 'P00533' for EGFR, 'P01116' for KRAS)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/proteomicsdb_tools.rst:80 44efe9f3ca37460287fdd7bb63211c59
msgid ""
"``tissue_category`` (string) (optional) Filter by biological source "
"category. 'tissue' for normal tissues, 'cell line' for cell lines, "
"'fluid' for body fluids, 'all' for everything. Default: all."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/proteomicsdb_tools.rst:83 7fbb558fcf4646ffb1b946515d61944b
msgid ""
"``calculation_method`` (string) (optional) Protein quantification method."
" iBAQ (intensity-Based Absolute Quantification) or TOP3 (sum of top 3 "
"peptide intensities). Default: iBAQ."
msgstr ""

