#: ../../tools/proteomicsdb_tools.rst:145 1795f4837061488ea23223d8de8b6c9c
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search ProteomicsDB for proteins by gene symbol, UniProt"
" accession, or protein name. ProteomicsDB contains mass spectrometry-"
"based proteomics data for human (and other organisms) proteins. Returns "
"matching protein entries with UniProt IDs, gene names, protein names, "
"entry names, and molecular masses. Useful for finding the correct UniProt"
" accession before querying expression data with "
"ProteomicsDB\\_get\\_protein\\_expression. Searches across gene name, "
"UniProt ID, and protein name fields simultaneously."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/proteomicsdb_tools.rst:152 861e74fa53b844909fac0eb1e739d5c4
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search term - gene symbol (e.g., 'KRAS', "
"'TP53'), UniProt ID (e.g., 'P04637'), or protein name keyword (e.g., "
"'kinase', 'GTPase KRas')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/proteomicsdb_tools.rst:155 446b7e58c5834dd999d432641a230ed5
msgid ""
"``organism_id`` (integer) (optional) NCBI taxonomy ID for organism "
"filter. Default: 9606 (human). Other options: 10090 (mouse), 10116 (rat)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/proteomicsdb_tools.rst:158 ffb035281cfc4489b9957972e8293230
msgid ""
"``max_results`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of results to return "
"(default: 20, max: 100)"
msgstr ""

